    <div class="container">
        <!-- OVERVIEW -->
        <section id="overview" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Project Overview</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Forging a gown as unique as your rebellion</p>
            
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Project Started</div>
                    <div class="stat-value" style="font-size: 1.5rem;">Oct 1<br>2025</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Fittings Complete</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">1 / 4</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Estimated Completion</div>
                    <div class="stat-value" style="font-size: 1.5rem;">July 15<br>2026</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>About This Document</h3>
                <p>Welcome to your personal Sadie System™ — a living, shared space where we document every detail of your dress creation journey. This document evolves with us as we bring your vision to life.</p>
                <p>Here you'll find design inspiration, fitting notes, material choices, timeline updates, and the ongoing story of your gown. Think of it as the biography of your dress — a keepsake you'll treasure long after your wedding day.</p>
                <p><strong>You own this document forever.</strong> Download it, share it with loved ones, or keep it private. It's yours.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <div class="divider">⚙ ✨ ⚙</div>
        
        <!-- VISION -->
        <section id="vision" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Alex's Vision</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">The rebellion we're designing</p>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>The Feeling</h3>
                <p>"I want to look like a fairy queen who runs a motorcycle garage. Structured but delicate. Dangerous but beautiful. I want to feel powerful and ethereal at the same time. Think Victorian workshop meets enchanted forest."</p>
                
                <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Key Words</h3>
                <div style="margin: 1rem 0;">
                    <span class="tag">Industrial</span>
                    <span class="tag">Ethereal</span>
                    <span class="tag">Structured</span>
                    <span class="tag">Rebellious</span>
                    <span class="tag">Delicate</span>
                    <span class="tag">Powerful</span>
                    <span class="tag">Unconventional</span>
                </div>
                
                <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Style References</h3>
                <p><strong>Era Inspiration:</strong> Victorian industrial revolution meets cyberpunk fantasy</p>
                <p><strong>Modern Twist:</strong> Deconstructed elements, asymmetrical details, mixed textures</p>
                <p><strong>Color Palette:</strong> Charcoal, metallic gold and bronze, deep plum, with pops of fairy green</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>The Wedding Context</h3>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> The Ironworks, converted Victorian factory with exposed brick and steel beams</p>
                <p><strong>Ceremony:</strong> Industrial courtyard with hanging Edison bulbs and wildflowers</p>
                <p><strong>Reception:</strong> Main factory floor with live industrial band</p>
                <p><strong>Season:</strong> Late August (expecting warm, urban heat)</p>
                <p><strong>Vibe:</strong> Urban, edgy, artistic. 120 guests. Live industrial folk band.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mood at Each Stage</h3>
                <div class="mood-tracker">
                    <div class="mood-item">
                        <div class="mood-emoji">⚡</div>
                        <div class="mood-label">Initial Consult<br><em>Excited & Defiant</em></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mood-item">
                        <div class="mood-emoji">🔧</div>
                        <div class="mood-label">Design Phase<br><em>Focused & Creative</em></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mood-item">
                        <div class="mood-emoji">✨</div>
                        <div class="mood-label">First Fitting<br><em>Surprised & Emotional</em></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mood-item">
                        <div class="mood-emoji">🔥</div>
                        <div class="mood-label">Second Fitting<br><em>Confident & Powerful</em></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <div class="divider">⚙ ✨ ⚙</div>
        
        <!-- TIMELINE -->
        <section id="timeline" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Project Timeline</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Major milestones from first sketch to final fitting</p>
            
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker complete"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">October 1, 2025</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Initial Consultation</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">First meeting at the atelier. Brought motorcycle jacket and vintage tools as inspiration. Discussed "punk fairy" vision, took initial measurements. Alex loved the metallic fabric swatches. Deposit received.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status complete">Complete</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker complete"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">October 15, 2025</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Design Sketches Presented</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">Shared three design concepts. Alex chose Design C (asymmetrical structured bodice with delicate tulle skirt). Decided on charcoal silk faille with bronze metallic embroidery.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status complete">Complete</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker complete"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">October 30, 2025</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">First Fitting - Muslin Mock-up</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">First fitting in muslin toile. Adjusted shoulder structure (more angular), waist (more fitted), and skirt volume (increased for drama). Alex loved the silhouette. "This is so me!" moment.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status complete">Complete</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker upcoming"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">December 20, 2025</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Second Fitting - Fabric Construction</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">Dress taking shape in actual fabrics! Will focus on structural elements, metallic embroidery placement, and asymmetrical details. Expect to finalize sleeve design.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status upcoming">Upcoming</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker upcoming"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">March 15, 2026</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Third Fitting - Detail Work</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">Focus on metallic embroidery, gear details, and structural elements. Will finalize hem length and train. Expect to add final industrial-inspired embellishments.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status upcoming">Upcoming</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker upcoming"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">June 10, 2026</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Fourth Fitting - Nearly Complete</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">Dress should be 95% finished. Final adjustments, ensure everything moves and has the right balance of structure and flow. Practice moving in the industrial elements.</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status upcoming">Upcoming</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker upcoming"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">July 15, 2026</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Final Pickup & Dress Rehearsal</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">The big reveal! Final fitting, steam and press, care instructions provided. Alex takes her dress home. Celebration with craft beer!</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status upcoming">Upcoming</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-marker upcoming"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">August 22, 2026</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">⚡ The Wedding Day!</div>
                    <div class="timeline-description">All our work comes to life. Can't wait to see photos!</div>
                    <span class="timeline-status upcoming">The Big Day</span>
                </div>
